# AllSearch — environment
#
# Nothing here is a user-facing setting. The user's AI provider keys
# deliberately do NOT live in this file: they are entered in the app's
# settings screen and stored locally (see issue 08 and ADR 0004), because a
# desktop app cannot ask its user to edit a dotfile.

# Where the SQLite database lives. Defaults to the platform application-data
# directory (~/Library/Application Support/AllSearch/allsearch.db on macOS).
# Override for tests. See issue 04.
# ALLSEARCH_DB_PATH=

# Playwright target. See issue 21.
# PLAYWRIGHT_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Where the drizzle/ migration SQL lives. The `allsearch` CLI sets this itself
# (the standalone server chdir's away from the package root, so neither the
# working directory nor __dirname can find them); set it by hand only when
# running the server from somewhere other than the repo root. See issue 20.
# ALLSEARCH_MIGRATIONS_DIR=

# Path to the built standalone server the CLI boots. Overrides the default of
# <package>/.next/standalone/server.js. For testing the CLI only. See issue 20.
# ALLSEARCH_SERVER_ENTRY=
